{{nihongo|'''Kirishima-Jingū'''|霧島神宮|}} is a Shinto shrine located in [[Kirishima, Kagoshima|Kirishima]], [[Kagoshima prefecture]], [[Japan]]. It is dedicated to [[Konohanasakuya-hime]], [[Hoori]], [[Toyotama-hime]], [[Ugayafukiaezu]] and [[Tamayoribime]]. This shrine holds several [[Important Cultural Properties of Japan|Important Cultural Properties]], such as ''Honden''・''Heiden''・''Haiden'' （本殿・幣殿・拝殿）, ''Tōrōka'' （登廊下）, ''Chōkushiden'' （勅使殿） etc.

